  "h1": [
    "Procedures"
  ],
  "word_count": 669,
  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# Procedures\n\n\nWe provide comprehensive oral and maxillofacial surgery, including jaw correction, wisdom tooth removal, facial pain and injury treatment, TMJ disorder care, dental implants, and bone grafting.\n\n\n## Dental Implants\n\n\nThis procedure not only restores the appearance of natural teeth but also improves functionality, allowing patients to eat, speak, and smile with confidence.\n\nLearn More\n\n\n## All-on-Four Dental Implants\n\n\nThe All-on-Four technique provides a full set of teeth using just four strategically placed implants in the upper or lower jaw.\n\n\n## Wisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\nRemoval of these teeth, typically performed under sedation, helps prevent complications such as impacted teeth or damage to adjacent teeth.\n\n\n## Facial Trauma\n\n\nFacial trauma refers to injuries involving the face and jaws, including fractures, lacerations, and damage to soft tissues.\n\n\n## Sedation Dentistry\n\n\nSedation dentistry involves the use of sedative medications to help patients relax and remain comfortable during dental procedures.\n\n\n## Sinus Lift\n\n\nA sinus lift is a specialized bone grafting procedure that augments the bone in the upper jaw, specifically in the area of the molars and premolars.\n\n\n## Teeth-In-One-Hour™\n\n\nTeeth-In-One-Hour™ is a revolutionary procedure that allows patients to receive dental implants and fully functioning teeth in just one hour.\n\n\n## Orthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\n\nCorrects jaw misalignment, improving function, bite, and facial balance. This procedure is ideal for those with issues in chewing, speaking, or breathing, and significantly enhances functionality and aesthetics.\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
